  "description": "For 6 years, Seung-Chae has had a crush on his childhood friend's older brother, Yoo-Geon. However, after hearing that Yoo-Geon applied to a hospital in the countryside, Seung-Chae decides to give up his hopeless crush. That day, Yoo-Geon appears in Seung-Chae's dream. Seung-Chae thinks this is his last chance and attacks Yoo-Geon... This lewd dream, which seemed like it would end in one go, continued for over ten days. \n\n *But is this really a dream? Why does it keep feeling real?*\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
